{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2021-04-22 17:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER INCREASES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "CLEVELAND, APRIL 22, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE: PH), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.03 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 7, 2021. \xa0THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 4, 2021.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND REPRESENTS A 17% INCREASE OVER THE PREVIOUS QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 88 CENTS PER COMMON SHARE AND IS THE COMPANY'S 284TH CONSECUTIVE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND."}{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2021-04-22 16:30:00', 'title': 'PARKER ELECTS WILLIAM F. LACEY TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, APRIL 22, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE: PH), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ELECTION OF WILLIAM F. LACEY TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE APRIL 22, 2021.'}